h the awards.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For all three award choices, seat evidence and award traveler support are unknown; the separately booked SFO–LAX legs are not confirmed protected, and their USD 59 quotes also have unknown scope. The provider status is partial and results may not be current, so confirm availability, taxes, and current prices with the booking providers before relying on any option.\"}]}"
